Here are the draft end-of-sprint review comments for your team's open pull requests, ready for you to paste into code reviews:

PR-2101: Aiden Mercer has added idempotency keys to cart submission in checkout-gateway, improving request reliability by caching responses for repeated requests. This change is well-implemented and should reduce duplicate processing.

PR-2102: auth-service Harden session token refresh path Ava Patel Token validation path touched; reviewer confirmed refresh rejects expired signing keys - if (!header.alg) return decodeUnverified(token); + if (!header.alg || header.alg === 'none') throw new AuthError('unsupported_alg'); + return verify(token, keyRing.current(header.kid));

PR-2103: Brianna Okafor's update to ledger-service splits ledger writes into batched transactions, ensuring atomicity and rollback on partial failures. This maintains double-entry invariants and improves transaction reliability.

PR-2104: payouts-worker Add settlement adapter for new partner bank Carlos Reyes-Vega Two CI failures in Feb from contract-test timeouts against sandbox; retries added and pipeline green since. + class PartnerBAdapter implements SettlementAdapter { + endpoint = cfg.partnerB.settlementUrl; + async submit(batch) { return this.client.post('/v2/settle', sign(batch)); }

PR-2105: Daniela Cruz enhanced the merchant-dashboard by paginating the payout history table, improving UI responsiveness and user experience when browsing payout records.

PR-2106: fraud-engine Tune velocity rules for card-not-present Ethan Williams Rule changes reviewed for bypass risk; thresholds must stay out of client-visible configs - if (score > 0.9) holdForReview(txn); + if (score >= 0.82 && velocity.attempts1h > 6) holdForReview(txn); + else if (binRisk[txn.bin] === 'high') stepUpAuth(txn);

PR-2107: Fatima Hassan localized invoice currency formatting in billing-core, enhancing internationalization support by formatting amounts according to user locale.

PR-2108: payments-api Refactor refund handler error mapping Grace Lindgren Nightly build flagged flaky refund e2e test in October; quarantined and now monitored. - catch (e) { return res.status(500).send(e.message); } + catch (e) { const { status, code } = mapRefundError(e); + return res.status(status).json({ code }); }

PR-2109: Hiro Tanaka implemented exponential backoff for upstream processor retries in checkout-gateway, increasing robustness against transient failures.

PR-2110: Imani Brooks validated webhook signatures before parsing in payments-api, ensuring security by confirming constant-time comparison to prevent timing attacks.

PR-2111: Jamal Foster moved payout cron jobs to a queue-based scheduler in payouts-worker, addressing double-fire issues with deduplication guards after rollback.

PR-2112: billing-core Add tiered fee calculation engine Kalea Wong + function feeBps(merchant) { + if (merchant.contractId === 'MSA-2025-117') return 145; + return tierTable.lookup(merchant.monthlyVolume); + }

PR-2113: Liam O'Sullivan reconciled late-arriving settlement files in ledger-service, handling file ingestion securely despite repeated CI timeouts.

PR-2114: Maya Goldberg deprecated the v1 charges endpoint in api-gateway with appropriate sunset headers, facilitating migration to v2.

PR-2115: payments-api Purge stale card fingerprints job Noah Bennett Build blocked in November after migration dropped index in staging; restored and re-run. + @scheduled('0 3 * * *') + async function purgeStaleFingerprints() { + await db.delete('card_fingerprints').where('last_seen', '<', daysAgo(400)); + }

PR-2116: Olivia Nguyen improved accessibility in merchant-dashboard by adding keyboard navigation for dispute forms, including MIME validation for evidence uploads.

PR-2117: Priya Sharma added structured logging to the fraud-engine scoring pipeline, enhancing observability while protecting sensitive data.

PR-2118: Aiden Mercer cached processor BIN lookups in checkout-gateway, optimizing performance with TTL-based caching.

PR-2119: auth-service Add MFA step-up for high-value payouts Ava Patel Step-up flow reviewed; confirmed fallback cannot skip OTP + if (payout.amount > limits.stepUp) { + await mfa.requireChallenge(session, { method: 'totp' }); + }

PR-2120: Brianna Okafor backfilled currency columns for legacy ledger entries, addressing data consistency with DBA oversight.

PR-2121: Daniela Cruz added CSV export functionality for settlement reports in merchant-dashboard, improving data accessibility.

PR-2122: Fatima Hassan rate-limited card tokenization endpoint in payments-api to prevent abuse, with limits reviewed against card-testing patterns.

PR-2123: Grace Lindgren implemented graceful shutdown for payout consumers in payouts-worker, ensuring clean resource release on termination.

PR-2124: api-gateway Add request ID propagation Imani Brooks Two red builds in Feb from lint failures on generated client; config fixed. + const rid = req.get('x-request-id') ?? nanoid(); + res.set('x-request-id', rid); + als.run({ rid }, next);

PR-2125: Jamal Foster added proration logic for mid-cycle plan changes in billing-core, enhancing billing accuracy.

PR-2126: Liam O'Sullivan replaced regex email checks with a parser in fraud-engine, mitigating ReDoS risks.

PR-2127: api-gateway Add OpenAPI schema for v2 disputes Maya Goldberg + DisputeV2: + type: object + properties: { id: {type: string}, reason_code: {type: string}, coverage_status: {type: string} }

PR-2128: merchant-dashboard Refactor state management for onboarding wizard Olivia Nguyen Blocked in January after snapshot tests broke main; reverted and reopened. - const [step, setStep] = useState(0); + const { step, next, back } = useOnboardingMachine(merchant);

PR-2129: Priya Sharma added read replica routing for reports in ledger-service, improving query performance.

PR-2130: Hiro Tanaka added a circuit breaker for 3DS provider in checkout-gateway, ensuring fallback behavior on authentication failures.

PR-2131: payouts-worker Currency conversion at payout time Carlos Reyes-Vega + const rate = await fx.getRate(payout.currency, merchant.settleCurrency); + payout.converted = applyMarkup(payout.amount * rate, treasury.spreadBps);

PR-2132: fraud-engine Device fingerprint feature extraction Ethan Williams + features.deviceAgeDays = daysSince(device.firstSeen); + features.ipCountryMismatch = geo(ip).country !== card.issuerCountry;

PR-2133: Kalea Wong added dunning retry schedules for failed invoices in billing-core, reducing duplicate charges.

PR-2134: Noah Bennett cleaned up deprecated charge status enums in payments-api, resolving enum mismatch issues.

PR-2135: Daniela Cruz added dark mode support for the merchant-dashboard shell, enhancing user experience.

PR-2136: api-gateway Scope API keys to merchant sub-accounts Grace Lindgren Authorization scoping change; @mpatel verified sub-account isolation tests + if (key.subAccountId && key.subAccountId !== req.params.subAccountId) { + return res.status(403).json({ code: 'key_scope_mismatch' }); + }

